        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Flattening the dense matrices into row-major contiguous vectors should eliminate per-row allocations and pointer indirection, improving locality for repeated full-row scans and matrix copies without changing traversal order.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
          "files": [
