        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "The split minimum-key scan has no loop-carried dependency: each iteration reads distinct array elements and contributes one candidate to an integer minimum. An OpenMP SIMD reduction may vectorize this scan while the unchanged second pass retains the earliest-index tie-break and the INT_MAX sentinel behavior.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
