        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "The sortedness check compares independent adjacent pairs and already uses a legal SIMD OR-reduction. Distributing that reduction across OpenMP workers for sufficiently large arrays may reduce validation time, while the size guard avoids parallel-region overhead on small inputs.",
