        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A single row-major byte buffer should reduce per-row allocation overhead and improve adjacency scan locality compared with vector<vector<bool>>, while retaining the exhaustive permutation search.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
