          "retained": [
            "Replace nested vector<bool> adjacency storage with a contiguous row-major byte matrix and cache row pointers during verification.",
            "Compute vertex degrees after the identity fast path; reject unequal degree multisets and skip permutations whose mapped vertex degrees differ before exact adjacency verification."
          ]
        },
        "status": "valid",
        "mean_seconds": 0.006325242730478446,
