        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "The measured contiguous byte matrix and exact degree-based rejection should retain the best known sequential path; comparing degree multisets with a single frequency-balance pass instead of sorted copies may reduce setup overhead while preserving the identity shortcut and Heap-order output.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
