        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "GCC can SIMD-vectorize the independent per-column median, standard-deviation, and coefficient-of-variation loops without reordering any floating-point reduction, while zero-initializing mode counters removes their dependence on uninitialized heap contents.",
