        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A single static OpenMP work-sharing loop over independent columns should expose parallelism while avoiding repeated team start-up across the metric passes. A workload threshold keeps small inputs on the serial path; per-column accumulation order and output order remain unchanged.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
