        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Buffering input in small row tiles and then scattering contiguous runs into the existing column-major layout should reduce cache-line waste from strided input writes for sufficiently large matrices, without changing the later per-column calculations.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
