        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Because each column is sorted before mode calculation, equal non-NaN values are contiguous. Scanning runs finds the same first mode in O(rows) work instead of pairwise O(rows²) comparisons, without reordering any floating-point reduction.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
