        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Static OpenMP work sharing over independent column sorts can speed up sufficiently large sort workloads while a comparison-count threshold keeps small workloads serial; initializing mode counters also makes mode results deterministic.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
