        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A compact contiguous max-heap for the k nearest candidates should reduce repeated O(k) shifts and keep top-k state bounded to a compact working set. Encounter-order keys preserve stable distance ties, while the existing label sort preserves the majority-vote tie rule.",
