        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Static OpenMP work sharing over balanced top-row chunks should retain the O(N² + windows²) sliding-window algorithm while reducing fork and redundant per-thread seeding overhead when there are too few windows relative to the requested worker count.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
