        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "A single flat row-major matrix and a contiguous sweep over column sums should improve locality while finding the maximum in O(N²) work. The full matrix is retained, trading O(N²) storage for simple sequential row access and O(N) accumulator storage.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
