        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "The previous SIMD reduction loop used a compound controlling predicate that the compiler rejected. Using a precomputed invariant count gives the OpenMP SIMD loop a canonical bound while preserving its independent prefix-difference calculations, so it should compile and retain vectorization opportunities without changing the general maximum-sum computation.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
