        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Partitioning window start columns into balanced static stripes lets each OpenMP thread maintain its own rolling vertical column sums and scan all top-row positions without per-row work-sharing barriers. This keeps the scan O(N²), uses only O(N + T·S) extra storage, and may reduce synchronization relative to parallelizing every row of windows.",
