        ],
        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Combining a persistent OpenMP team with a compact position array may retain the verified parallel speedup while reducing the memory traffic of the all-pairs position scan. The source-body accumulation order remains unchanged.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
          "files": [
            "src/nbody.c"
          ],
          "retained": [
            "Extract the per-body force calculation while preserving the original ascending source-body accumulation order; use one persistent OpenMP team with static worksharing for force and position loops across iterations.",
