        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Using a 2D prefix table lets each row's cumulative sum for a column stripe be read directly, removing the loop-carried running-sum recurrence while preserving the sequential histogram updates needed for correctness. This may shorten the scan's dependency chain, though the hash-map work remains scalar.",
