        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Accumulating each pair of boundaries along the shorter matrix dimension while scanning a contiguous, oriented long dimension should improve locality and eliminate the extra prefix-sum matrix. A generation-stamped frequency table avoids clearing or reallocating a hash map for every band while supporting the full signed prefix-sum range.",
