        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Replacing the 2D prefix-table scan with incremental sums for each stripe pair removes the prefix-table construction and its loop-carried dependencies. Storing the shorter dimension first makes the independent accumulator-update loop contiguous and suitable for GCC vectorization; the frequency-map scan remains sequential to preserve prefix-count dependencies. This may help, but performance requires controller measurement.",
