        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "For horizons at most 64 terms beyond the supplied base, directly advancing the recurrence avoids dense matrix powering. A duplicated circular window and blocked contiguous dot-product reductions may make the independent products easier for the compiler to vectorize, while preserving a matrix-power fallback for larger distances.",
